[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23103.59, "timestamp": "06:25:03", "text": "去。是的。所以，正如我刚才所说，呃，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23108.15, "timestamp": "06:25:08", "text": "像直播网站一样玩游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23111.27, "timestamp": "06:25:11", "text": "他们从……呃，什么时候开始的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23113.868, "timestamp": "06:25:13", "text": "11月3日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23120.35, "timestamp": "06:25:20", "text": "星期五晚上 8:00呃，美国东部时间到周日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23124.27, "timestamp": "06:25:24", "text": "呃，星期天下午5点左右。凌晨5点或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23127.35, "timestamp": "06:25:27", "text": "某物。是着火了吗？我忘了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23130.59, "timestamp": "06:25:30", "text": "是的。所以，我扮演的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23134.23, "timestamp": "06:25:34", "text": "呃，减少了。不，不，不。这就像一个“不”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23139.39, "timestamp": "06:25:39", "text": "我扮演的是一个……啊，我到底在玩什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23141.628, "timestamp": "06:25:41", "text": "作为？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23157.75, "timestamp": "06:25:57", "text": "你"}]